        "content": "<report>\nBAYLINE BUILDERS - SUPERINTENDENT DAILY REPORT\nForm DR-1 rev 3\n================================================================\nProject:          Harbor Point Medical Office Building\nJob No.:          2417\nReport Date:      2026-09-22\nSuperintendent:   Dana Okafor\nReport No.:       16\n\nWEATHER\nConditions:       Heavy rain\nHigh / Low (F):   66 / 60\nWeather Delay (hrs): 8\n\nMANPOWER\nCompany                         | Trade          | Headcount | Hours\n----------------------------------------------------------------\nBayline Builders (self-perform) | laborers       | 3         | 8\nKeystone Interiors LLC          | drywall        | 9         | 8\nVolt Line Electric, Inc.        | electrical     | 7         | 8\nTidewater Mechanical            | hvac           | 6         | 8\nClearwater Plumbing Co.         | plumbing       | 3         | 8\nRedline Fire Protection         | fire_sprinkler | 3         | 8\nTOTAL                           |                | 31        |\n\nWORK COMPLETED\n- [L2 west] (hvac) Insulated supply duct\n- [L1 east] (electrical) Terminated devices in exam rooms\n- [L2 east] (laborers) Moved board stock to work areas\n- [L1 east] (fire_sprinkler) Installed branch lines and hangers\n\nDELAYS\n- weather | 8 hrs | Heavy rain all day; roofing and curtain wall did not work\n\nSAFETY\n- None\n\nINSPECTIONS\n- None\n\nDELIVERIES\n- None\n\nVISITORS\n- None\n\nNOTES\nInterior trades worked full day. Pumped water from elevator pit.\n</report>\n\nExtract this report with record_daily_report."
